# Runtime/test SQLite databases (KungFuChessAccounts/SqliteUserRepository) -
# kungfuchess.db is the server's own data file; test_*.db are temp files
# created by AuthServiceSqliteTests.cpp, normally cleaned up but left
# behind if a test run crashes mid-way.
